{"seq":2,"slug":"b2b-bulk-liquidation-auction","title":"B2B 批量清货/拍卖渠道（边界064/153）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/clearance-channels/b2b-bulk-liquidation-auction","wordCount":2164,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"b2b-批量清货-拍卖渠道-边界064-153\">B2B 批量清货/拍卖渠道（边界064/153）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>当一批货已经不适合逐件零售时，出口不再是&quot;更低的价格&quot;，而是<strong>不同的交易结构</strong>。逐件零售的成本结构是&quot;每单拣货、每单包装、每单配送、每单客服&quot;，清仓尾货恰恰单价低、退货率高、履约成本占比大；而 B2B 批量交易把 N 件商品打包成<strong>一个交易单位</strong>，履约成本从&quot;每件&quot;变成&quot;每批&quot;，单价折让换来的是履约成本的断崖式下降与时间上的确定性。</p>\n<p>这个渠道的核心机制是<strong>用批量折扣购买确定性</strong>：零售清仓的不确定性在于&quot;能不能卖完、要多久&quot;，B2B 交易一次成交、一次出库、一次结算，剩余的不确定性转移给了买方。代价是买方要求的折让通常远大于零售折扣——因为他们要承担转售风险、承担品类滞销的风险、承担资金占用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[清仓尾货批次] --&gt; B{批次是否可打包?}&#10;  B --&gt;|可| C[定义交易单位&lt;br/&gt;SKU 组合 + 数量 + 等级]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D[拆分或转处置]&#10;  C --&gt; E{选择交易机制}&#10;  E --&gt;|定价整批| F[一口价批量出售]&#10;  E --&gt;|竞价| G[密封报价 / 公开拍卖]&#10;  E --&gt;|协商| H[定向议价]&#10;  F --&gt; I[买方验货与收货]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[结算与凭证留档]\">graph TD\n  A[清仓尾货批次] --&gt; B{批次是否可打包?}\n  B --&gt;|可| C[定义交易单位&lt;br/&gt;SKU 组合 + 数量 + 等级]\n  B --&gt;|否| D[拆分或转处置]\n  C --&gt; E{选择交易机制}\n  E --&gt;|定价整批| F[一口价批量出售]\n  E --&gt;|竞价| G[密封报价 / 公开拍卖]\n  E --&gt;|协商| H[定向议价]\n  F --&gt; I[买方验货与收货]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[结算与凭证留档]</pre><h2 id=\"交易结构的选择\">交易结构的选择</h2><h3 id=\"三种机制与适用场景\">三种机制与适用场景</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>交易成本</th>\n<th>价格发现能力</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一口价整批</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>弱（靠经验定价）</td>\n<td>品类常见、买家众多、价格可参照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密封报价</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中（一次性出价）</td>\n<td>买家有限、价值需保密的批次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公开拍卖（英式/荷式）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>买家众多且价值不确定的批次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定向议价</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>弱但可控</td>\n<td>长期合作买家、超大批次</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择的关键变量是<strong>价值不确定性</strong>与<strong>买家数量</strong>。批次价值越不确定、买家越多，拍卖的价格发现价值越大；反之定向议价更快。在线拍卖平台在交易机制上的完整设计（出价、保留价、延时、反狙击）属于在线拍卖主题的范围，本篇只取用其&quot;保留价 + 密封报价&quot;这个最小可用子集。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保留价-拍卖的底线工程\">保留价：拍卖的底线工程</h3><p>拍卖必须设保留价（reserve price），否则可能出现远低于残值的成交。保留价的设定不应等于&quot;希望卖到的价&quot;，而应基于<strong>处置替代成本</strong>：如果这批货走不了 B2B，下一步是捐赠或报废，那么报废的直接成本（处置费、仓储费、机会成本）之和就是保留价的下限——低于它的成交还不如直接处置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def reserve_price(batch, disposal_cost_per_unit, carry_cost_per_unit_week,&#10;                  expected_weeks_to_dispose):&#10;    # 不成交时的净成本（负数表示支出）&#10;    fallback_cost = -(disposal_cost_per_unit&#10;                      + carry_cost_per_unit_week * expected_weeks_to_dispose)&#10;    # 保留价须让成交收入 &gt;= fallback 的成本节省&#10;    return max(0.0, -fallback_cost * batch.units) / batch.units\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reserve_price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(batch, disposal_cost_per_unit, carry_cost_per_unit_week,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                  expected_weeks_to_dispose):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 不成交时的净成本（负数表示支出）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fallback_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(disposal_cost_per_unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                      +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carry_cost_per_unit_week </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_weeks_to_dispose)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 保留价须让成交收入 >= fallback 的成本节省</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fallback_cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch.units) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch.units</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用&quot;替代方案的成本节省&quot;来定义保留价，比用&quot;成本加成&quot;更诚实：它承认了清仓的目标是减少损失而不是追求利润。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批次打包与定价\">批次打包与定价</h2><h3 id=\"交易单位的构造\">交易单位的构造</h3><p>B2B 买家最不喜欢的不是低价，而是<strong>批次内含有卖不掉的货</strong>。因此打包策略的核心是控制批次内的<strong>品类纯度</strong>与<strong>尺码/规格分布</strong>——混入大量断码、残次品会导致流拍或极大的折让。常见的打包维度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;lot_id&quot;: &quot;LOT-2026-1027-APPAREL-003&quot;,&#10;  &quot;grade&quot;: &quot;A&quot;,&#10;  &quot;contents_summary&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;style_count&quot;: 42,&#10;    &quot;total_units&quot;: 3800,&#10;    &quot;size_curve&quot;: { &quot;XS&quot;: 0.04, &quot;S&quot;: 0.18, &quot;M&quot;: 0.31, &quot;L&quot;: 0.29, &quot;XL&quot;: 0.14, &quot;XXL&quot;: 0.04 },&#10;    &quot;defect_ratio_pct&quot;: 1.2,&#10;    &quot;season&quot;: &quot;2026-SS&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;pricing&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;cost_basis_total&quot;: 118000.0,&#10;    &quot;reserve_price_total&quot;: 26000.0,&#10;    &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;,&#10;    &quot;incoterms&quot;: &quot;EXW&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;constraints&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;no_split&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;inspection_window_days&quot;: 7,&#10;    &quot;settlement&quot;: &quot;bank_transfer_30d&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lot_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LOT-2026-1027-APPAREL-003\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"grade\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"contents_summary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"style_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"total_units\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"size_curve\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"XS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.04</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"S\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"M\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.31</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"L\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.29</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"XL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"XXL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.04</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"defect_ratio_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"season\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-SS\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pricing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"cost_basis_total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">118000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reserve_price_total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">26000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"incoterms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EXW\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"constraints\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"no_split\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"inspection_window_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"settlement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bank_transfer_30d\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>grade</code>（等级）是最重要的标量：它把批次的可转售程度压缩成一个可比较的标签（A 级可正价转售、B 级适合折扣渠道、C 级仅适合加工或再利用）。等级错标是 B2B 纠纷的主要来源，因此等级应基于<strong>客观抽检</strong>而非库存系统的账面状态。</p>\n<p>等级的客观依据可以借用零售商品状态的标准分类：在商品结构化数据中，<code>condition</code> 取 <code>new</code>（全新未使用、原包装未开封）、<code>refurbished</code>（经专业修复至外观如新并附带保修）或 <code>used</code>（二手，或&quot;相对制造商出厂状态已被改动&quot;，如出现磨损、缺少原包装、被定制或签名）（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6324469\">Google Merchant Center: condition</a>）。这套三分法可以直接映射到清仓批次等级：<code>new</code> 对应 A 级，<code>refurbished</code> 对应 B 级（需经检修中心处理，见 <a href=\"donation-disposal-salvage-proof\">捐赠/报废与残值凭证</a> 对检修与处置的边界说明），<code>used</code> 对应 C 级。用标准词汇而非自定义标签的好处是买方与平台对&quot;这批货是什么成色&quot;有共同理解，减少验货争议。</p>\n<h3 id=\"定价锚点-从成本到可转售价值\">定价锚点：从成本到可转售价值</h3><p>B2B 买方的出价逻辑不是&quot;你的成本是多少&quot;，而是&quot;这批货我转手能卖多少、扣掉我的成本还剩多少&quot;。因此可用的定价锚点是<strong>买方视角的可转售价值</strong>：以买方所在市场/渠道同类商品的售价为基准，扣掉其渠道毛利、履约成本、滞销风险，剩下的就是他们能付的上限。这个视角解释了为什么同一个批次卖给不同市场的买家报价可以差好几倍——不是买家在压价，而是可转售价值本身就不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与批发-拍卖两个相邻业务的边界\">与批发、拍卖两个相邻业务的边界</h2><p>清仓型 B2B 与常规批发业务容易混淆，区分点在于<strong>货源性质与决策驱动</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>常规批发（064）</th>\n<th>清仓型 B2B 批量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>货源</td>\n<td>计划性生产/采购</td>\n<td>零售滞销尾货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策驱动</td>\n<td>渠道扩张与销量目标</td>\n<td>库龄与截止线压力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定价逻辑</td>\n<td>成本加成 + 渠道价格体系</td>\n<td>替代处置成本 + 可转售价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批次构成</td>\n<td>完整尺码/色系</td>\n<td>断码、混尺码、混款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频次</td>\n<td>稳定周期</td>\n<td>非周期性、随清仓节奏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格稳定性</td>\n<td>有价格表</td>\n<td>一批一价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>因此清仓 B2B 不应走常规批发的价格体系（否则会把清仓价写进经销商的参照系，破坏他们的正价销售），而应建立<strong>独立的批次交易通道</strong>，一批一价、独立结算。这与 <a href=\"../markdown-decision-optimization/clearance-margin-brand-price-guard\">清仓毛利回收与品牌价格保护</a> 中的渠道隔离要求一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"执行与结算\">执行与结算</h2><h3 id=\"验货窗口与争议处理\">验货窗口与争议处理</h3><p>批量交易的特点是&quot;买方在成交前难以完整验证&quot;，因此必须设计<strong>验货窗口</strong>：买方在收货后 N 天内可提出质量异议，超过窗口则视为接受。窗口的长度是双方风险的分配——窗口越长，买方越愿意出高价，但卖方的应收款周期越长、争议风险越高。工程上需要把这个窗口建模为交易对象的一个状态，并在争议发生时冻结结算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE b2b_lot_deal (&#10;  lot_id         VARCHAR(48) PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  buyer_id       BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  deal_type      VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- &#39;fixed&#39;|&#39;sealed_bid&#39;|&#39;auction&#39;|&#39;negotiated&#39;&#10;  units          DECIMAL(18,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  gross_amount   DECIMAL(18,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  currency       CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  state          VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL,   -- &#39;draft&#39;|&#39;offered&#39;|&#39;awarded&#39;|&#39;shipped&#39;|&#39;inspecting&#39;|&#39;settled&#39;|&#39;disputed&#39;&#10;  reserve_amount DECIMAL(18,2),&#10;  awarded_at     TIMESTAMP,&#10;  shipped_at     TIMESTAMP,&#10;  inspect_until  TIMESTAMP,&#10;  settled_at     TIMESTAMP,&#10;  audit_ref      VARCHAR(64)              -- 指向处置/转移凭证&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_lot_deal_state ON b2b_lot_deal (state, inspect_until);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> b2b_lot_deal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lot_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">48</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  buyer_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deal_type      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'fixed'|'sealed_bid'|'auction'|'negotiated'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  units          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gross_amount   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'draft'|'offered'|'awarded'|'shipped'|'inspecting'|'settled'|'disputed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reserve_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  awarded_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shipped_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  inspect_until  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  settled_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  audit_ref      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 指向处置/转移凭证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_lot_deal_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b2b_lot_deal (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, inspect_until);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>audit_ref</code> 字段是把 B2B 通道与下游处置凭证连接起来的关键——它让&quot;这批货最终去了哪里&quot;在系统内可追溯，而这正是 ESG 与合规披露所需的证据链，详见 <a href=\"donation-disposal-salvage-proof\">捐赠/报废与残值凭证</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"出库与库存扣减的时序\">出库与库存扣减的时序</h3><p>批量交易最容易出错的工程细节是<strong>何时扣减可售库存</strong>。成交即扣会高估出清（货还没出仓库，买方可能毁约）；出库才扣会低估（货已承诺但仍在账上，可能被其他渠道重复出售）。稳妥的做法是引入<strong>承诺态库存</strong>：成交后数量从 <code>available</code> 转入 <code>committed_b2b</code>，出库时转出，违约时释放回 <code>available</code>。这与零售订单的预留逻辑同构，可直接复用库存服务已有的预留机制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与上游清仓计划的联动\">与上游清仓计划的联动</h3><p>B2B 交易的批次构成应由清仓计划驱动，而不是先有批次再找货。当某个 SKU 的 <code>progress_ratio</code> 持续低于阈值且距截止线不足若干周时，系统应生成<strong>批次候选集</strong>供 B2B 通道打包，参见 <a href=\"../markdown-decision-optimization/stock-to-go-clearance-curve\">stock-to-go 与清仓曲线</a> 的进度偏差监控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>B2B 批量清货的本质是<strong>用批量折扣购买确定性</strong>：把履约成本从&quot;每件&quot;压成&quot;每批&quot;，把&quot;能否卖完&quot;的风险转移给买方。</li>\n<li>交易机制按价值不确定性与买家数量选择：一口价最快、密封报价居中、公开拍卖价格发现最强；出价与竞价机制的完整设计属于在线拍卖主题。</li>\n<li>保留价应基于<strong>替代处置成本</strong>（报废费 + 仓储 + 机会成本），低于它的成交不如直接处置。</li>\n<li>打包的关键是批次纯度与等级标注；等级应基于客观抽检，错标是纠纷主因。</li>\n<li>定价锚点是买方视角的<strong>可转售价值</strong>而非卖方成本，这解释了同批次在不同市场报价的巨大差异。</li>\n<li>清仓 B2B 与常规批发（064）在货源、驱动、定价逻辑上都不同，必须走独立交易通道、一批一价，以保护经销商价格体系。</li>\n<li>成交与扣减库存之间需要<strong>承诺态</strong>过渡；交易的 <code>audit_ref</code> 向下连接处置凭证，形成去向可追溯的证据链。</li>\n<li>流拍或残值过低的批次转入 <a href=\"donation-disposal-salvage-proof\">捐赠/报废与残值凭证</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"B2B 批量清货/拍卖渠道（边界064/153）","id":"b2b-批量清货-拍卖渠道-边界064-153"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"交易结构的选择","id":"交易结构的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"三种机制与适用场景","id":"三种机制与适用场景"},{"level":3,"text":"保留价：拍卖的底线工程","id":"保留价-拍卖的底线工程"},{"level":2,"text":"批次打包与定价","id":"批次打包与定价"},{"level":3,"text":"交易单位的构造","id":"交易单位的构造"},{"level":3,"text":"定价锚点：从成本到可转售价值","id":"定价锚点-从成本到可转售价值"},{"level":2,"text":"与批发、拍卖两个相邻业务的边界","id":"与批发-拍卖两个相邻业务的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"执行与结算","id":"执行与结算"},{"level":3,"text":"验货窗口与争议处理","id":"验货窗口与争议处理"},{"level":3,"text":"出库与库存扣减的时序","id":"出库与库存扣减的时序"},{"level":3,"text":"与上游清仓计划的联动","id":"与上游清仓计划的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"站内 outlet 专区与搜索曝光（联017）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/clearance-channels/outlet-zone-search-exposure"},"next":{"title":"捐赠/报废与残值凭证（边界126）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/clearance-channels/donation-disposal-salvage-proof"}}